' Rejected: `start` inside a fork branch.
' `start` is the diagram-level entry point, unique and top-level.
' Putting it inside a fork branch is semantically meaningless (the
' branch is already entered when fork runs).
' Rewrite: remove the inner `start`. If the branch represents a
' sub-process with its own entry, make it a partition, or extract
' it into a separate diagram.
@startuml
start
:主処理;
fork
  start
  :並行処理 A;
fork again
  :並行処理 B;
end fork
stop
@enduml
